%% Telemetry ingestion and alarm state machine
sequenceDiagram
    participant N as ESP32 node
    participant B as MQTT broker
    participant W as n8n
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant T as Telegram
    N->>B: measurement (boot_id, seq, value, time quality)
    B->>W: deliver (QoS 1)
    W->>D: ingest_measurement(topic, payload)
    D-->>W: stored / duplicate / rejected
    W->>B: ack (stored or duplicate)
    B->>N: ack
    loop every 5 minutes
        W->>D: evaluate_alarms()
        D->>D: NORMAL → PENDING → ALARM (20 min)<br/>recovery: 10 min inside range, 1 °C hysteresis<br/>stale 15 min · node offline 15 min
        D-->>W: outbox rows
        W->>T: send message
        W->>D: mark sent
    end
